  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As part of spending any amount of skill leverage on a Sense Motive or analyze check, you learn if the check would succeed if you roll a 10 on the d20 roll. If the action would be successful under those circumstances, you must take the action; if the action would not be successful, you can take a different action. For every 3 ranks in the associated skill you possess, you can increase or decrease the original value that you determine if the roll would succeed or not by 1 (e.g. at 6 ranks, you can choose to see if you would succeed at an 8, 9, 10, 11, or 12).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
